direction: right

A: Engineer\ndefines intent\nin Nautobot
B: Aerleon\ntranslates to\nvendor config
C: Batfish\nvalidates\noffline
D: Safe? {shape: diamond}
E: Block +\nalert engineer
F: Pull Request\n& peer review
G: Merge →\nAnsible/Nornir\npushes to prod
H: Reconciliation\nloop detects drift

A -> B
B -> C
C -> D
D -> E: No
D -> F: Yes
F -> G
G -> H
H -> A: Drift found
